{"page":318,"width":1656,"height":2505,"text_angle":0,"lines":[{"text":"376 Chapter8 교착 상대","words":[{"text":"376","x":177,"y":142,"width":58,"height":28},{"text":"Chapter8","x":304,"y":145,"width":146,"height":28},{"text":"교착","x":476,"y":147,"width":41,"height":24},{"text":"상대","x":525,"y":149,"width":40,"height":24}]},{"text":"8.8 교착 상대로부터 회복 from Deadlock","words":[{"text":"8.8","x":178,"y":270,"width":90,"height":34},{"text":"교착","x":305,"y":266,"width":72,"height":41},{"text":"상대로부터","x":388,"y":268,"width":166,"height":40},{"text":"회복","x":568,"y":268,"width":66,"height":40},{"text":"from","x":820,"y":275,"width":74,"height":25},{"text":"Deadlock","x":906,"y":275,"width":160,"height":26}]},{"text":"탐지 알고리즘이 교착 상대가 한한다고 결정하면, 여러 대안의 처리 방법이 있다. 한","words":[{"text":"탐지","x":305,"y":357,"width":57,"height":35},{"text":"알고리즘이","x":379,"y":357,"width":143,"height":35},{"text":"교착","x":538,"y":358,"width":57,"height":34},{"text":"상대가","x":608,"y":356,"width":84,"height":36},{"text":"한한다고","x":704,"y":354,"width":143,"height":36},{"text":"결정하면,","x":864,"y":354,"width":122,"height":36},{"text":"여러","x":1003,"y":355,"width":57,"height":35},{"text":"대안의","x":1080,"y":356,"width":91,"height":36},{"text":"처리","x":1192,"y":357,"width":59,"height":35},{"text":"방법이","x":1271,"y":356,"width":95,"height":35},{"text":"있다.","x":1387,"y":355,"width":68,"height":34},{"text":"한","x":1472,"y":357,"width":30,"height":33}]},{"text":"가지 방법은 교착 상태가 발생한 것을 운영자(operator)에게 통지해, 운영자가 수작업","words":[{"text":"가지","x":306,"y":414,"width":56,"height":35},{"text":"방법은","x":379,"y":415,"width":89,"height":35},{"text":"교착","x":481,"y":416,"width":57,"height":33},{"text":"상태가","x":552,"y":415,"width":84,"height":35},{"text":"발생한","x":648,"y":414,"width":87,"height":35},{"text":"것을","x":749,"y":412,"width":54,"height":36},{"text":"운영자(operator)에게","x":816,"y":412,"width":304,"height":41},{"text":"통지해,","x":1137,"y":414,"width":106,"height":34},{"text":"운영자가","x":1259,"y":412,"width":134,"height":36},{"text":"수작업","x":1407,"y":412,"width":90,"height":35}]},{"text":"으로 처리하게 뿌는 것이다. 다른 방법은 시스템이 지동으로 교착 상대로부터 회복하게","words":[{"text":"으로","x":304,"y":474,"width":61,"height":28},{"text":"처리하게","x":380,"y":472,"width":113,"height":35},{"text":"뿌는","x":508,"y":472,"width":57,"height":35},{"text":"것이다.","x":579,"y":472,"width":88,"height":35},{"text":"다른","x":681,"y":472,"width":57,"height":34},{"text":"방법은","x":750,"y":471,"width":86,"height":35},{"text":"시스템이","x":849,"y":469,"width":113,"height":36},{"text":"지동으로","x":979,"y":470,"width":123,"height":35},{"text":"교착","x":1117,"y":471,"width":65,"height":33},{"text":"상대로부터","x":1195,"y":470,"width":161,"height":35},{"text":"회복하게","x":1375,"y":470,"width":123,"height":36}]},{"text":"하는 것이다. 교착 상태를 깨뜨리는 데는 두 가지 방법이 있다. 한 가지 방법은 순환 대","words":[{"text":"하는","x":305,"y":530,"width":61,"height":35},{"text":"것이다.","x":380,"y":529,"width":92,"height":36},{"text":"교착","x":487,"y":530,"width":57,"height":34},{"text":"상태를","x":557,"y":530,"width":85,"height":35},{"text":"깨뜨리는","x":655,"y":529,"width":113,"height":36},{"text":"데는","x":780,"y":528,"width":56,"height":36},{"text":"두","x":848,"y":530,"width":29,"height":34},{"text":"가지","x":891,"y":528,"width":54,"height":35},{"text":"방법이","x":962,"y":527,"width":88,"height":36},{"text":"있다.","x":1069,"y":528,"width":67,"height":35},{"text":"한","x":1153,"y":528,"width":33,"height":34},{"text":"가지","x":1201,"y":528,"width":60,"height":34},{"text":"방법은","x":1280,"y":528,"width":99,"height":34},{"text":"순환","x":1392,"y":527,"width":66,"height":33},{"text":"대","x":1472,"y":529,"width":25,"height":35}]},{"text":"기를 깨뜨리기 위해 단순히 한 개 이상의 스레드를 중지(abort)시기는 것이다. 두 번째","words":[{"text":"기를","x":306,"y":588,"width":59,"height":35},{"text":"깨뜨리기","x":379,"y":587,"width":112,"height":36},{"text":"위해","x":509,"y":588,"width":53,"height":35},{"text":"단순히","x":577,"y":588,"width":81,"height":35},{"text":"한","x":674,"y":588,"width":29,"height":34},{"text":"개","x":717,"y":587,"width":24,"height":36},{"text":"이상의","x":757,"y":587,"width":81,"height":35},{"text":"스레드를","x":854,"y":586,"width":118,"height":35},{"text":"중지(abort)시기는","x":985,"y":585,"width":270,"height":38},{"text":"것이다.","x":1271,"y":585,"width":104,"height":35},{"text":"두","x":1392,"y":587,"width":32,"height":32},{"text":"번째","x":1441,"y":585,"width":56,"height":36}]},{"text":"방법은 교착 상태에 있는 하나 이상의 스레드들로부터 자원을 선점(preempt)하는 것","words":[{"text":"방법은","x":304,"y":646,"width":91,"height":35},{"text":"교착","x":409,"y":646,"width":60,"height":34},{"text":"상태에","x":482,"y":646,"width":83,"height":35},{"text":"있는","x":583,"y":646,"width":55,"height":34},{"text":"하나","x":652,"y":646,"width":56,"height":35},{"text":"이상의","x":723,"y":645,"width":82,"height":35},{"text":"스레드들로부터","x":821,"y":645,"width":205,"height":35},{"text":"자원을","x":1046,"y":644,"width":95,"height":35},{"text":"선점(preempt)하는","x":1157,"y":643,"width":298,"height":41},{"text":"것","x":1472,"y":645,"width":27,"height":35}]},{"text":"이다.","words":[{"text":"이다.","x":305,"y":704,"width":66,"height":35}]},{"text":"8 8.1 프로세스와 스레드의 종료 Process and Thread Termination","words":[{"text":"8","x":303,"y":813,"width":28,"height":29},{"text":"8.1","x":347,"y":814,"width":59,"height":29},{"text":"프로세스와","x":445,"y":813,"width":135,"height":32},{"text":"스레드의","x":588,"y":813,"width":105,"height":32},{"text":"종료","x":704,"y":813,"width":54,"height":32},{"text":"Process","x":780,"y":821,"width":111,"height":21},{"text":"and","x":900,"y":821,"width":54,"height":21},{"text":"Thread","x":963,"y":821,"width":100,"height":21},{"text":"Termination","x":1073,"y":821,"width":173,"height":21}]},{"text":"프로세스 또는 스레드를 중지(abort)시김으로써 교착 상태를 제거하기 위해 우리는 두","words":[{"text":"프로세스","x":303,"y":885,"width":121,"height":35},{"text":"또는","x":437,"y":887,"width":59,"height":32},{"text":"스레드를","x":508,"y":885,"width":114,"height":34},{"text":"중지(abort)시김으로써","x":634,"y":884,"width":300,"height":38},{"text":"교착","x":951,"y":885,"width":62,"height":35},{"text":"상태를","x":1025,"y":885,"width":95,"height":35},{"text":"제거하기","x":1136,"y":885,"width":124,"height":35},{"text":"위해","x":1281,"y":884,"width":62,"height":35},{"text":"우리는","x":1361,"y":883,"width":98,"height":36},{"text":"두","x":1472,"y":887,"width":31,"height":33}]},{"text":"방법의 하니를 A卜\u0026한다. 두 방법 모두, 종료된 프로세스에게 할당되었던 모든 자원을 시","words":[{"text":"방법의","x":304,"y":943,"width":87,"height":35},{"text":"하니를","x":405,"y":944,"width":87,"height":35},{"text":"A卜\u0026한다.","x":503,"y":942,"width":119,"height":36},{"text":"두","x":634,"y":945,"width":29,"height":33},{"text":"방법","x":674,"y":943,"width":53,"height":34},{"text":"모두,","x":740,"y":945,"width":65,"height":33},{"text":"종료된","x":816,"y":944,"width":88,"height":34},{"text":"프로세스에게","x":915,"y":944,"width":182,"height":35},{"text":"할당되었던","x":1112,"y":944,"width":161,"height":35},{"text":"모든","x":1286,"y":945,"width":67,"height":32},{"text":"자원을","x":1365,"y":942,"width":97,"height":35},{"text":"시","x":1474,"y":944,"width":25,"height":35}]},{"text":"스템이 회수한다.","words":[{"text":"스템이","x":303,"y":1002,"width":88,"height":35},{"text":"회수한다.","x":405,"y":1001,"width":122,"height":36}]},{"text":"• 교착 상태 프로세스를 모두 중지. 이 방식은 확실하게 교착 상태의 사이클을 깨뜨리","words":[{"text":"•","x":323,"y":1099,"width":13,"height":13},{"text":"교착","x":358,"y":1090,"width":63,"height":34},{"text":"상태","x":430,"y":1090,"width":56,"height":35},{"text":"프로세스를","x":499,"y":1089,"width":144,"height":35},{"text":"모두","x":653,"y":1091,"width":58,"height":33},{"text":"중지.","x":722,"y":1089,"width":64,"height":35},{"text":"이","x":801,"y":1088,"width":24,"height":36},{"text":"방식은","x":841,"y":1090,"width":89,"height":34},{"text":"확실하게","x":941,"y":1090,"width":120,"height":36},{"text":"교착","x":1076,"y":1091,"width":65,"height":34},{"text":"상태의","x":1153,"y":1090,"width":95,"height":35},{"text":"사이클을","x":1265,"y":1090,"width":132,"height":35},{"text":"깨뜨리","x":1411,"y":1089,"width":89,"height":36}]},{"text":"지만, 그 비용이 크다. 왜냐하면, 이들 프로세스가 오랫동안 연산했을 기능성이 있으","words":[{"text":"지만,","x":360,"y":1148,"width":66,"height":36},{"text":"그","x":438,"y":1153,"width":29,"height":23},{"text":"비용이","x":480,"y":1148,"width":80,"height":35},{"text":"크다.","x":574,"y":1148,"width":64,"height":35},{"text":"왜냐하면,","x":651,"y":1148,"width":122,"height":35},{"text":"이들","x":786,"y":1148,"width":58,"height":35},{"text":"프로세스가","x":854,"y":1149,"width":151,"height":35},{"text":"오랫동안","x":1016,"y":1149,"width":127,"height":34},{"text":"연산했을","x":1157,"y":1149,"width":130,"height":34},{"text":"기능성이","x":1300,"y":1147,"width":126,"height":35},{"text":"있으","x":1445,"y":1147,"width":59,"height":34}]},{"text":"며, 이들 부분 계산의 결괴들을 반드시 폐기해야 하며, 아마도 후에 다시 계산해야","words":[{"text":"며,","x":360,"y":1206,"width":36,"height":36},{"text":"이들","x":412,"y":1206,"width":57,"height":35},{"text":"부분","x":482,"y":1207,"width":58,"height":33},{"text":"계산의","x":554,"y":1206,"width":82,"height":34},{"text":"결괴들을","x":653,"y":1206,"width":115,"height":35},{"text":"반드시","x":781,"y":1206,"width":84,"height":35},{"text":"폐기해야","x":883,"y":1207,"width":121,"height":35},{"text":"하며,","x":1018,"y":1207,"width":69,"height":35},{"text":"아마도","x":1104,"y":1207,"width":96,"height":35},{"text":"후에","x":1215,"y":1207,"width":63,"height":34},{"text":"다시","x":1297,"y":1206,"width":61,"height":34},{"text":"계산해야","x":1379,"y":1205,"width":126,"height":35}]},{"text":"하기 때문이다.","words":[{"text":"하기","x":359,"y":1264,"width":56,"height":35},{"text":"때문이다.","x":430,"y":1264,"width":120,"height":35}]},{"text":"• 교착 상태가 제거될 때까지 한 프로세스씩 중지: 이 방법은 각 프로세스가 중지될 때","words":[{"text":"•","x":323,"y":1342,"width":13,"height":14},{"text":"교착","x":358,"y":1333,"width":62,"height":35},{"text":"상태가","x":428,"y":1332,"width":88,"height":36},{"text":"제거될","x":525,"y":1332,"width":84,"height":35},{"text":"때까지","x":622,"y":1333,"width":83,"height":34},{"text":"한","x":718,"y":1333,"width":31,"height":33},{"text":"프로세스씩","x":757,"y":1333,"width":145,"height":35},{"text":"중지:","x":916,"y":1333,"width":67,"height":35},{"text":"이","x"