"/卜능한","x":1155,"y":1737,"width":99,"height":35},{"text":"상대로","x":1265,"y":1738,"width":100,"height":34},{"text":"부구해야","x":1377,"y":1737,"width":128,"height":35}]},{"text":"한다.","words":[{"text":"한다.","x":307,"y":1797,"width":66,"height":35}]},{"text":"만일 부분 종료 방식을 사용한다면, 교착 상태인 프로세스들의 집합 중에서 교착 상","words":[{"text":"만일","x":363,"y":1855,"width":56,"height":33},{"text":"부분","x":433,"y":1856,"width":58,"height":34},{"text":"종료","x":500,"y":1858,"width":58,"height":32},{"text":"방식을","x":569,"y":1855,"width":85,"height":35},{"text":"사용한다면,","x":665,"y":1854,"width":151,"height":37},{"text":"교착","x":829,"y":1856,"width":60,"height":34},{"text":"상태인","x":899,"y":1855,"width":89,"height":35},{"text":"프로세스들의","x":1001,"y":1854,"width":187,"height":36},{"text":"집합","x":1206,"y":1855,"width":66,"height":34},{"text":"중에서","x":1284,"y":1853,"width":96,"height":36},{"text":"교착","x":1397,"y":1854,"width":65,"height":34},{"text":"상","x":1474,"y":1854,"width":32,"height":35}]},{"text":"태를 깨뜨리기 위해 어느 프로세스(들)를 중지해야 할지를 반드시 결정해야 한다. 이러","words":[{"text":"태를","x":308,"y":1913,"width":59,"height":34},{"text":"깨뜨리기","x":380,"y":1913,"width":112,"height":35},{"text":"위해","x":509,"y":1913,"width":53,"height":34},{"text":"어느","x":578,"y":1913,"width":56,"height":34},{"text":"프로세스(들)를","x":646,"y":1913,"width":195,"height":37},{"text":"중지해야","x":853,"y":1913,"width":120,"height":35},{"text":"할지를","x":986,"y":1913,"width":93,"height":36},{"text":"반드시","x":1093,"y":1913,"width":92,"height":35},{"text":"결정해야","x":1206,"y":1913,"width":133,"height":36},{"text":"한다.","x":1353,"y":1913,"width":72,"height":35},{"text":"이러","x":1444,"y":1912,"width":57,"height":36}]},{"text":"한 결정은 CPU 스케줄링 문제와 유사한 정책 결정의 문제이며, 이 문제는 기본적으로","words":[{"text":"한","x":307,"y":1970,"width":31,"height":33},{"text":"결정은","x":352,"y":1970,"width":87,"height":34},{"text":"CPU","x":450,"y":1974,"width":68,"height":27},{"text":"스케줄링","x":531,"y":1970,"width":110,"height":35},{"text":"문제와","x":657,"y":1970,"width":87,"height":35},{"text":"유사한","x":755,"y":1971,"width":88,"height":35},{"text":"정책","x":856,"y":1971,"width":54,"height":35},{"text":"결정의","x":927,"y":1971,"width":86,"height":36},{"text":"문제이며,","x":1029,"y":1971,"width":135,"height":36},{"text":"이","x":1182,"y":1972,"width":27,"height":34},{"text":"문제는","x":1227,"y":1972,"width":103,"height":36},{"text":"기본적으로","x":1345,"y":1971,"width":159,"height":36}]},{"text":"경제적인 문제이다. 즉, 프로세스들을 중지시겼을 때 유발되는 비용이 최소인 프로세스","words":[{"text":"경제적인","x":309,"y":2027,"width":116,"height":34},{"text":"문제이다.","x":438,"y":2028,"width":120,"height":35},{"text":"즉,","x":573,"y":2029,"width":35,"height":34},{"text":"프로세스들을","x":622,"y":2028,"width":170,"height":34},{"text":"중지시겼을","x":804,"y":2029,"width":147,"height":35},{"text":"때","x":965,"y":2029,"width":26,"height":35},{"text":"유발되는","x":1007,"y":2030,"width":126,"height":34},{"text":"비용이","x":1149,"y":2030,"width":93,"height":36},{"text":"최소인","x":1262,"y":2031,"width":98,"height":36},{"text":"프로세스","x":1377,"y":2030,"width":127,"height":36}]},{"text":"들을 중지시켜야 한다. 불행하게도 최소 비용이라는 용어는 정확한 것이 아니다. 어느 교","words":[{"text":"들을","x":306,"y":2084,"width":61,"height":33},{"text":"중지시켜야","x":377,"y":2085,"width":146,"height":35},{"text":"한다.","x":532,"y":2085,"width":63,"height":34},{"text":"불행하게도","x":607,"y":2085,"width":141,"height":34},{"text":"최소","x":758,"y":2086,"width":56,"height":33},{"text":"비용이라는","x":828,"y":2086,"width":144,"height":34},{"text":"용어는","x":982,"y":2088,"width":94,"height":34},{"text":"정확한","x":1088,"y":2088,"width":98,"height":35},{"text":"것이","x":1198,"y":2090,"width":61,"height":35},{"text":"아니다.","x":1276,"y":2090,"width":107,"height":36},{"text":"어느","x":1400,"y":2089,"width":62,"height":36},{"text":"교","x":1477,"y":2093,"width":25,"height":17}]},{"text":"로세스를 선택할지 결정하는 데는 다음과 같은 많은 요인이 있다.","words":[{"text":"로세스를","x":306,"y":2141,"width":120,"height":34},{"text":"선택할지","x":437,"y":2142,"width":110,"height":34},{"text":"결정하는","x":562,"y":2141,"width":112,"height":35